---
description: "Wardley map exercising the `pipeline` block syntax: a Kettle
  pipeline containing three sub-components (Campfire, Electric, Smart Kettle) at
  different evolution stages, each linked back into the parent Kettle
  component."
---
wardley-beta
title Kettle Evolution Pipeline
size [1100, 800]

component Kettle [0.57, 0.45]
component Power [0.1, 0.7]
component User [0.95, 0.5]

pipeline Kettle {
  component Campfire Kettle [0.35] label [-60, 35]
  component Electric Kettle [0.53] label [-60, 35]
  component Smart Kettle [0.72] label [-30, 35]
}

Kettle -> Power
User -> Electric Kettle
Campfire Kettle -> Kettle
Electric Kettle -> Kettle
Smart Kettle -> Kettle
